@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC13 Quan ly tour ban dich va thu tu diem dung

actor "Admin / ContentAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - TourListPage va TourEditPage" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nToursController + TourService + SoftDeleteService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nTourRepository + TourTranslationRepository + TourPoiRepository + PoiRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo danh sach hoac trang sua tour
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau doc tour
Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen
Business -> DataAccess: Doc tour, ban dich va diem dung
DataAccess -> Database: Doc Tour, TourTranslation, TourPoi va Poi
Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu
DataAccess --> Business: Tra tour
Business --> UI: Hien thi du lieu

alt Tao hoac cap nhat tour
  Actor -> UI: Nhap thong tin tour
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau luu
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra ngon ngu va du lieu
  Business -> DataAccess: Ghi Tour
  DataAccess -> Database: Tao hoac cap nhat tour
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra tour moi
else Quan ly ban dich tour
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau them, sua hoac xoa ban dich
  Business -> DataAccess: Kiem tra tour, ngon ngu va trung lap
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc va ghi TourTranslation
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra ket qua
  Business --> UI: Tra ban dich moi
else Gan, bo hoac sap xep POI
  UI -> Business: Gui danh sach diem dung
  Business -> DataAccess: Kiem tra tour, POI va thu tu
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc va ghi TourPoi
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra ket qua
  Business --> UI: Tra thu tu moi
else Xoa tour
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau xoa
  Business -> DataAccess: Danh dau xoa va ghi DeletedRecord
  DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat Tour va tombstone
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
end
alt Thao tac hop le
  UI --> Actor: Cap nhat man hinh tour
else Khong tim thay, trung lap hoac sai thu tu
  Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi va giu du lieu cu
end
@enduml
